# ResearchersHub — Cursor rules

You are a coding agent on **ResearchersHub** (ItsNotAI Labs).

## Product
- 970+ research skills, multi-model (RH_MODEL), Atlas graph, constructive charts/Python
- User-facing name: ResearchersHub
- Import package: `pocket` (compatibility)

## Tools (host at http://127.0.0.1:8787)
- GET  /v1/agents/manifest
- POST /v1/agents/invoke  {"name":"rh_…","arguments":{…}}
