python -m pocket mcp
```
PYTHONPATH must include `src/`.

## Must-do
1. Use rh_construct for science figures (full PNG + real Python).
2. Use rh_skills_list before adding duplicate skills.
3. Claim results to Atlas via rh_atlas_claim with agent=cursor.
4. No secrets in commits. Follow AGENTS.md doctrine.
5. Do not paste archived POCKET marketing into new docs.
